2845
02:09:58.210 --> 02:10:01.330
And I laughed at, I stood up in my bar stool

2846
02:10:01.330 --> 02:10:05.781
and I minded that it's raging proposed day one,

2847
02:10:05.781 --> 02:10:06.614
everyones at the bar.

2848
02:10:06.614 --> 02:10:10.070
And I'm like, whoever having put this guy up to this,

2849
02:10:10.070 --> 02:10:11.747
like real funny.

2850
02:10:11.747 --> 02:10:14.207
And I threw up the bird, I sat back down.

2851
02:10:14.207 --> 02:10:15.910
The guy tapped me on the shoulder again

2852
02:10:15.910 --> 02:10:20.500
and he's like, now he's got the in E.S.P.N card is like,

2853
02:10:20.500 --> 02:10:24.850
no, I mean and I'm like, and that was

2854
02:10:24.850 --> 02:10:27.350
he had seen me in a documentary called Snow Taxi.

2855
02:10:27.350 --> 02:10:29.470
And I had also done some stuff at that point

2856
02:10:29.470 --> 02:10:31.610
a couple of like, one-offs at M.T.V,

2857
02:10:31.610 --> 02:10:33.580
there sports and music festivals.

2858
02:10:33.580 --> 02:10:37.600
And this little public access show called Planet X

2859
02:10:37.600 --> 02:10:39.520
that was basically my start,

2860
02:10:39.520 --> 02:10:42.100
which came from a guy not being there

2861
02:10:42.100 --> 02:10:44.420
to interview Tony Hawk at the board event.

2862
02:10:44.420 --> 02:10:45.283
And the guy coming up to the stage and be like,

2863
02:10:45.283 --> 02:10:47.170
hey, do you know Tony Hawk?

2864
02:10:47.170 --> 02:10:48.250
Can you interview him for me?

2865
