2869
02:11:00.560 --> 02:11:02.220
'cause they had been using stick and ball

2870
02:11:02.220 --> 02:11:04.430
like broadcast people and it was not translating.

2871
02:11:04.430 --> 02:11:07.180
Right, yeah, the community is not responding.

2872
02:11:07.180 --> 02:11:08.140
Not responding at all.

2873
02:11:08.140 --> 02:11:11.010
We watched it with the volume of I thought it was horrible.

2874
02:11:11.010 --> 02:11:12.680
You were stoked to see your friends competing,

2875
02:11:12.680 --> 02:11:15.650
but like, oh, when's this gonna just go away

2876
