2886
02:11:36.050 --> 02:11:38.440
Like I just was like, this is what I'm doing and--

2887
02:11:38.440 --> 02:11:41.430
Your life has a string of like not being aware enough

2888
02:11:41.430 --> 02:11:44.082
to know what the fuck is going on.

2889
02:11:44.082 --> 02:11:45.810
You're constantly getting these opportunities

2890
02:11:45.810 --> 02:11:48.360
