2891
02:11:48.360 --> 02:11:49.937
I said, no.
Yeah.

2892
02:11:49.937 --> 02:11:53.320
And I flew home and I sat with my team.

2893
02:11:53.320 --> 02:11:55.300
I go to go to the office at Alphanumeric

2894
02:11:55.300 --> 02:11:59.340
and giving them the rundown of the weekend

2895
02:11:59.340 --> 02:12:01.563
at the Vans Triple Crown and then I'm like, oh, yeah,

2896
02:12:01.563 --> 02:12:03.207
and then there was this dude who, you know,

2897
02:12:03.207 --> 02:12:05.830
he wanted me to do for some X Games

2898
02:12:05.830 --> 02:12:07.550
and he told me he wanted me to come on

2899
02:12:07.550 --> 02:12:12.550
and be a sideline reporter in a few weeks at Crested Butte.

