2901
02:12:13.610 --> 02:12:16.120
I was like, tell him I wasn't really interested.

2902
02:12:16.120 --> 02:12:19.940
My friends are like, what are you talking about?

2903
02:12:19.940 --> 02:12:24.380
Like, what are you actually, everybody was like, what?

2904
02:12:24.380 --> 02:12:26.160
I was like, well, we know we're doing this thing

2905
02:12:26.160 --> 02:12:29.460
and we're, you know, the brand, blah, blah, blah and like.

2906
02:12:29.460 --> 02:12:32.570
And they were like, you going there

2907
02:12:32.570 --> 02:12:34.320
and being a part of the thing

2908
02:12:34.320 --> 02:12:38.920
could actually be a representation of the culture

2909
02:12:38.920 --> 02:12:39.753
