2913
02:12:49.730 --> 02:12:52.350
Yeah, and I also like, but I also just like,

2914
02:12:52.350 --> 02:12:54.280
what do you mean me?

2915
02:12:54.280 --> 02:12:56.600
I'm gonna go there and make a difference.

2916
02:12:56.600 --> 02:12:58.690
Like it's E.S.P.N.

2917
02:12:58.690 --> 02:13:03.690
And they put their foot lovingly square between my cheeks

2918
02:13:03.960 --> 02:13:06.130
made me call the dude.

2919
02:13:06.130 --> 02:13:09.040
He actually called me back a couple of days later

2920
02:13:09.040 --> 02:13:10.980
