And I hadn't really been paid for television yet.

2924
02:13:21.720 --> 02:13:24.120
Like M.T.V I had made it a little bit of money

2925
02:13:24.120 --> 02:13:25.180
but you--

2926
02:13:25.180 --> 02:13:26.540
They don't pay.
They don't pay.

2927
02:13:26.540 --> 02:13:28.930
Like, you'd go and do the thing for

2928
02:13:28.930 --> 02:13:30.780
