2934
02:13:44.080 --> 02:13:45.020
Wow.

2935
02:13:45.020 --> 02:13:49.260
And I said, yes.

2936
02:13:49.260 --> 02:13:52.370
And this guy, Jamie Reynolds really took an interest in me

2937
02:13:52.370 --> 02:13:53.750
