2938
02:13:53.750 --> 02:13:57.100
And they put me on the sidelines at Halfpipe and Big Air.

2939
02:13:57.100 --> 02:14:00.030
And suddenly like these guys who hadn't

2940
02:14:00.030 --> 02:14:02.180
men and women who hadn't really been opening up

2941
02:14:02.180 --> 02:14:04.420
in their interviews, they get down to the bottom

2942
02:14:04.420 --> 02:14:06.443
