2966
02:15:09.470 --> 02:15:12.010
I was standing on the vert ramp when Tony did the 900.

2967
02:15:12.010 --> 02:15:13.990
Wow, wow.

2968
02:15:13.990 --> 02:15:15.960
He'll never, ever, ever forget it.

2969
02:15:15.960 --> 02:15:17.400
Yeah.

2970
02:15:17.400 --> 02:15:21.020
And it's, yeah, within about a year it was like

2971
02:15:21.020 --> 02:15:23.571
