2974
02:15:28.517 --> 02:15:30.530
Oh, and almost blew it many times.

2975
02:15:30.530 --> 02:15:31.420
Yeah.

2976
02:15:31.420 --> 02:15:32.253
Oh absolutely.

2977
02:15:33.931 --> 02:15:35.817
(all laughs)

2978
02:15:35.817 --> 02:15:37.970
Many times Rich.

2979
02:15:37.970 --> 02:15:38.970
Well, I think you found your lane

2980
02:15:38.970 --> 02:15:42.143
I mean, then you went on you did the Sochi Olympics, right?

2981
02:15:43.129 --> 02:15:45.650
You did world cup in South Africa in 2010.

2982
02:15:45.650 --> 02:15:46.640
Yeah, yeah.

2983
02:15:46.640 --> 02:15:50.100
You've done tons of stuff with N.B.C sports

2984
02:15:50.100 --> 02:15:51.810
this Viceland show.

2985
02:15:51.810 --> 02:15:55.130
Yeah, the Viceland show was like a real,

2986
02:15:55.130 --> 02:15:57.280
that was the--
Why are you not continue.

2987
02:15:58.310 --> 02:16:02.490
Vice World of Sports was, I was my baby.

2988
02:16:02.490 --> 02:16:04.400
That was like, I wanted to get

2989
02:16:04.400 --> 02:16:07.500
into like real docu storytelling

2990
02:16:07.500 --> 02:16:09.650
of culture and people through sports.

2991
02:16:09.650 --> 02:16:11.580
Right, so essentially you're going to these

2992
02:16:11.580 --> 02:16:14.600
really interesting places, immersing yourself

2993
02:16:14.600 --> 02:16:16.447
in the sport and the culture

2994
02:16:16.447 --> 02:16:19.840
