2995
02:16:19.840 --> 02:16:23.180
Exactly, you're in a remote fishing village in Ghana.

2996
02:16:23.180 --> 02:16:25.530
It's like if Anthony Bourdain was an athlete.

2997
02:16:26.640 --> 02:16:27.473
Essentially.
Yeah.

2998
02:16:27.473 --> 02:16:28.700
And it's funny that you mentioned him

2999
02:16:28.700 --> 02:16:31.680
because he was my touchstone like that's I was like,

3000
02:16:31.680 --> 02:16:35.920
I wanna do a show that is the Bourdain, but it's sports.

3001
02:16:35.920 --> 02:16:40.420
That's not like it's not, you know, real sports on H.B.O

3002
02:16:40.420 --> 02:16:42.510
where like, it comes back into the studio

3003
02:16:42.510 --> 02:16:44.530
and like someone rules on whether or not

3004
02:16:44.530 --> 02:16:45.800
we should be talking about this.

3005
02:16:45.800 --> 02:16:47.550
Like I wanna go and have people feel like

3006
02:16:47.550 --> 02:16:51.440
we went to this place and Vice gave me that opportunity.

3007
02:16:51.440 --> 02:16:55.240
But they, instead of like putting that show on H.B.O,

3008
02:16:55.240 --> 02:16:58.870
they launched Viceland and they had been primarily

3009
02:17:01.184 --> 02:17:02.933
