3012
02:17:09.250 --> 02:17:11.230
And now they wanted to make the leap to television

3013
02:17:11.230 --> 02:17:13.870
and instead of like selling that show to a network

3014
02:17:13.870 --> 02:17:16.490
we're launching up, we've done all this,

3015
02:17:16.490 --> 02:17:18.010
we can launch a network.

3016
02:17:18.010 --> 02:17:21.980
And they didn't really have like a long-term

3017
02:17:21.980 --> 02:17:25.223
real big kids plan for what that network was gonna be.

3018
02:17:26.060 --> 02:17:29.287
And they also went through a bunch of like challenges

3019
02:17:30.870 --> 02:17:32.200
